{"Title":"An Act relative to strengthening Massachusetts’ economic leadership","BillNumber":"H4789","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"H34","Name":"House Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34","ResponseDate":"2024-06-24T10:56:21.87"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"GOV7","Name":"Maura T. Healey","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/GOV7","ResponseDate":"2024-03-01T10:09:50.6633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4789/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":null,"EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to forthwith finance improvements to the commonwealth’s economic infrastructure, drive industry innovation, and promote economic opportunity and job creation, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"A","ParentBillNumber":"H4789","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4789/Branches/House/Amendments/A/"},{"AmendmentNumber":"B","ParentBillNumber":"H4789","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4789/Branches/House/Amendments/B/"},{"AmendmentNumber":"C","ParentBillNumber":"H4789","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4789/Branches/House/Amendments/C/"},{"AmendmentNumb